hi all,

 we found a bug in oSCR yesterday in the way it was handling the trap operation matrix. This only affects things if you were using the data2oscr function to convert EDF and TDF format data into the oSCR scrFrame structure.

 In any case, you can update directly from GitHub by doing this:

install.packages("githubinstall")

install.packages("devtools")

library(githubinstall)

library(devtools)

#install oSCR directly from github

install_github("jaroyle/oSCR")

